  "label": "Religious Hypocrisy",
  "description": "The act of pretending to hold religious beliefs while acting contrary to them, or applying religious principles inconsistently. The meme uses this concept to condemn those who are intolerant of other religions but demand tolerance for their own. This is a common theme in religious and political discourse, often used to criticize leaders or communities for double standards.",
